      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2001 S. Karger AG, Basel",
        "AbstractText": "Cysteinyl leukotrienes have been shown to be important in the pathogenesis of both asthma and rhinitis. Improvement of skin manifestations in atopic dermatitis has been reported with leukotriene receptor antagonists. This article reviews current data on the experimental evidence and clinical efficacy of leukotriene receptor antagonists in the treatment of atopic dermatitis."
